    "id": "3459107218",
    "isSimulated": false,
    "title": "《鬓老春稠 · 花卉其一 》Spring [4k/自定义/Customizable]",
    "description": "感谢订阅！喜欢的话点个赞关注一下！！！\n\n“且挽东风同一醉\n任鬓老，共春稠”\n清明归途感怀，得江城子残句一二，来日再填\n摄影：中国国家地理（不知道摄影老师姓名，在此致歉！）\nBGM: 《广府春秋》Phigma\n制作/诗词：SYKM\n\n说明：\n1.中国农历日期+节气的脚本还未测试完全，如有问题和错误还请告知，感激不尽！\n2.首次尝试用脚本做花瓣飘落的运动，只是希望你看到的每一瓣花瓣飘落的运动轨迹都是不同的，就像每个人的人生一样（当然背景的落叶用的是引擎自带的“樱花”，我承认偷懒了，以后有时间再改）；\n3.理论上应该不会卡顿，如果你觉得卡顿，占用内存过高，可以尝试关掉“雾”、“落花”和“落叶”等粒子特效；\n4.灵感来源于@Bewie 的壁纸“Persica”:\nhttps://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2359043440\n5.感谢@Bruhsty的雨滴素材“Simple Rain Droplets | Asset pac”\n\n有bug或者灵感可以在此处，或者bilibili反馈我会尽力修复\nhttps://space.bilibili.com/1552133264\n\nTranslation:\n\nThanks for subscribing! If you enjoy this, please like and follow! ✨\n\n“Clasp hands with the wind, share a drunken revelry—\nLet temples silver, age without care—\nRevel in spring’s lush prime, our mortal creed.”\n\nPhotography: China National Geography (Apologies for not crediting individual photographers!)\nBGM: \"Guangfu Chronicles\" by Phigma\nProduction/Poetry: SYKM\n\nProduction Notes\n1.Lunar calendar + solar term features still in beta testing. Please report any issues! \n2.First attempt at custom petal physics: Each blossom follows unique trajectories - just like human lives  (Background leaves use default \"sakura\" particles... I'll improve this later)\n3.Performance tips: Disable \"Fog\", \"Falling Flowers\" “Glass”and \"Falling Leaves\" particles if experiencing lag.\nCredits & Feedback\nInspiration: @Bewie's wallpaper \"Persica\"\nRain assets: @Bruhsty's \"Simple Rain Droplets\"\n\nBug reports/ideas:\nBilibili: [https://space.bilibili.com/1552133264]\n\n更新：\n2025/04/07更新 优化性能，缩减50%存储占用\n2025/04/09更新 @Aviiated\n1.新增时钟12h/24h制选择；\n2.新增中文中国农历日期、中文公历日期、英文公历日期可选择；\n3.新增中国24节气中英文显示可选。\n\nUpdates:\n2025/04/07 Update: Optimized performance, reduced storage usage by 50%.\n2025/04/09 Update:@Aviiated\n    1.Added 12h/24h clock format selection.\n    2.Added options for Chinese Lunar Calendar dates (Chinese), Gregorian dates (Chinese), and Gregorian dates (English).\n    3.Added display options for Chinese 24 Solar Terms in both Chinese and English.\n2025/05/11 更新：\n    1.修复了公历中文显示bug@万里飞霜 \n    2.修复了农历日期错误bug@b站：被**耽误的** \n    3.增加了传统节日优先于节气显示功能\n2025/06/10 更新：\n    1.修复了时间的“刻”的错误\n    2.节气更新精确到分钟",
